" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"acf90b9de82eb78c\" href=\"?note=acf90b9de82eb78c\" title=\"28-df-first-order-syntax\">28-df-first-order-syntax</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 元关系符号集, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"acf90b9de82eb78c\" href=\"?note=acf90b9de82eb78c\" title=\"28-df-first-order-syntax\">28-df-first-order-syntax</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n \\in \\mathbb{N}\">\\(n \\in \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (元数, 标准符号)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}=(A,(c^{\\mathfrak{A}})_c,(f^{\\mathfrak{A}})_f,(R^{\\mathfrak{A}})_R)\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}=(A,(c^{\\mathfrak{A}})_c,(f^{\\mathfrak{A}})_f,(R^{\\mathfrak{A}})_R)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-解释候选)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|\\mathfrak A|\\coloneqq A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|\\mathfrak A|\\coloneqq A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak{A}) \\Longleftrightarrow A\\neq\\emptyset \\;\\land\\; \\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}(S)\\;(c^{\\mathfrak{A}}\\in A) \\;\\land\\; \\forall n\\in\\mathbb{N}\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)\\;(f^{\\mathfrak{A}}:A^n\\to A) \\;\\land\\; \\forall n\\in\\mathbb{N}\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\\;(R^{\\mathfrak{A}}\\subseteq A^n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak{A}) \\Longleftrightarrow A\\neq\\emptyset \\;\\land\\; \\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}(S)\\;(c^{\\mathfrak{A}}\\in A) \\;\\land\\; \\forall n\\in\\mathbb{N}\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)\\;(f^{\\mathfrak{A}}:A^n\\to A) \\;\\land\\; \\forall n\\in\\mathbb{N}\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\\;(R^{\\mathfrak{A}}\\subseteq A^n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 是非空论域；其余分量分别解释 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的常量、函数和关系符号。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>来源状态：本目录的自足支撑定义；不把此形式语言包装或模型论扩展冒称原书编号定义。</p>\n<p>R7：补出结构的载体投影 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathfrak A|\\coloneqq A\">\\(|\\mathfrak A|\\coloneqq A\\)</span>。赋值、项解释和满足关系使用的论域现在由本节点前两节正式恢复，不再依靠 Remark 对元组分量的说明；结构谓词及解释分量未变。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-structure-—-结构-$\\mathfrak{A}$","text":"df-structure — 结构 $\\mathfrak{A}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-first-order-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"acf90b9de82eb78c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-first-order-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-first-order-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"acf90b9de82eb78c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ (一阶签名, see [[28-df-first-order-syntax]])","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-first-order-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"acf90b9de82eb78c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Const}(S)$ (常量符号集, see [[28-df-first-order-syntax]])","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-first-order-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"acf90b9de82eb78c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)$ ($n$ 元函数符号集, see [[28-df-first-order-syntax]])","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-first-order-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"acf90b9de82eb78c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"